ife and  when you talk to people who you see  videos of people were talking about you  know they're on their deathbed they're  looking back on their life and you never  see people regret taking their shot  right  you see people they look back in their  lives and I said they wish they took  more chances and so I don't want that to  be me if I want something if I'm excited  by something I want to be able to go up  and take my shot even if I'm afraid to  do it so I would apply that framework to  you  when you're seven you look back in your  life will you regret not having tried  these ideas if you're like now whatever  like if it works it works if not I don't  care then then you have your answer  don't worry about it go do your job  you're passionate about it your goal  you're golden but if you look back and  you think man I really that was a great  idea I really wish I gave it a shot  because I could always go back and get  another job then do it do it so when you  fast forward your life you don't have  any regrets believe those are watching I  love to hear your stories how did you  make a decision between one option and  another option maybe with a safe option  and the risky option what advice would  you have to give please leave it in the  comments below so other people can be  inspired by your story as well you guys  like this video thumbs up below click on  my face subscribe to the channel thank  you so much I'll see you soon
 

